    "Parametric lifts tonal regions. Point places anchors on the curve.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw curve picker tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数化模式按色调区域调整;控制点模式在曲线上放置锚点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RGB changes brightness. Red, green, and blue also shift the color.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw curve channel picker tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RGB 调整亮度;红、绿、蓝还会偏移颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag up or down to lift or lower those tones. Drag a divider along the bottom to change which tones each region covers.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw point curve: parametric-mode hint.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下拖动可抬升或压低对应色调;拖动底部分隔条可改变每段覆盖的色调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a point. Click to add one. Double-click a point to remove it.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw point curve: point-mode hint.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动调整控制点;点击添加;双击删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input and output of the selected curve point.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw curve read-out tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选曲线控制点的输入和输出值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replaces this curve with a straight line or a contrast curve.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw curve preset picker tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将曲线替换为直线或对比度曲线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw curve refine-saturation tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲线对色彩强度的附加影响。0 匹配 Photoshop;负值仅影响亮度,正值增加色彩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HSL lists every color. Color edits one family. Point Color adjusts a color you pick.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw mixer picker tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL 列出所有颜色;Color 编辑单个色族;Point Color 调整所拾取的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue shifts the color, Saturation its strength, and Luminance its brightness.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw mixer component picker tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相偏移颜色,饱和度调整强度,亮度调整明暗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a color in the picture. Nearby color families move together.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw mixer targeted adjustment tooltip.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在画面上拖动颜色,附近的色族会一起移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the picture to save a color. Up to eight colors.": {
      "comment": "Camera Raw point color hint.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击画面保存颜色,最多 8 个。"
